<p>A Russian An-26 military transport plane crashed in Crimea on Tuesday evening, killing all 29 people on board, including six crew members and 23 passengers, according to Russia&#x27;s Defense Ministry. Russian officials said preliminary information pointed to a technical malfunction.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Mission versatility: RT said the An-26 can carry up to 40 soldiers and also serves in paratrooper deployment and medical evacuation.</li><li>Last contact: Russian state media, citing the Defense Ministry, said officials lost contact with the aircraft at about 6 p.m. local time during a routine or planned flight over Crimea.</li><li>Crash setting: Reports citing Russian sources said the aircraft went down in mountainous terrain. SCMP described Crimea as a landscape of sweeping mountains descending to the Black Sea coast.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/russian-military-plane-crashes-annexed-crimea-killing-29-131603717'>Russian military plane crashes in annexed Crimea, killing 29 people on board</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/01/russian-military-transport-plane-crashes-in-crimea-killing-all-29-on-board'>Russian military transport plane crashes in Crimea, killing all 29 on board</a> - meduza.io</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1s9bcwz/a_russian_an26_military_transport_plane_crashed/'>A Russian An-26 military transport plane crashed into a cliff in Crimea, killing 29 people on board</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3348594/russian-military-plane-crashes-crimea-cliff-killing-29-people'>Russian military plane crashes into Crimea cliff, killing 29 people</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/636897-russian-military-transport-crashes/'>Russian military transport plane crashes in Crimea</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/29-killed-as-rus